# GPU-fit tuning: Qwen3.8-27B UD-Q4_K_XL on a single R9700 (MACHINE=r9700).
#
# Sourced by the launchers AFTER models/qwen3.8-27b-q4.env and BEFORE
# profiles/r9700/default.env.
#
# Q4 is the only Qwen3.8-27B weight class that leaves a single ~31 GiB R9700
# room for a real KV cache. UD-Q8_K_XL is 29.3 GiB of weights alone -- it
# technically loads but has nothing left for context, so it belongs on the pair
# (profiles/r9700-dual/qwen3.8-27b-q8.env), not here.
#
# KV math (verified from GGUF metadata 2026-08-14): 16 of 65 blocks are full
# attention (full_attention_interval 4), 4 KV heads x head_dim 256 x (K+V)
# = 32,768 elements/token -> ~34 KiB/token at q8_0. The 48 Gated DeltaNet
# blocks keep a constant-size SSM state rather than per-token KV.
#
# Memory budget vs ~31 GiB VRAM:
#   weights (UD-Q4_K_XL)             16.7 GiB
#   KV @ 262,144 tok, q8_0 K+V        8.5 GiB
#   vision projector (mmproj F16)     0.9 GiB
#   compute buffers @ ubatch 512     ~1.5 GiB
#   ------------------------------------------
#   total                            ~28 GiB / ~31 GiB VRAM   (margin ~3 GiB)
#
# That is the model's full native context on one card, which is the point of
# this config. The margin is thinner than it looks because this profile also
# pins ROCR/HIP to device 0 to hide the host iGPU (see
# profiles/r9700/default.env) -- if load OOMs, drop UBATCH to 256 first, then
# CTX_SIZE to 131072 (which frees 4.3 GiB and is very comfortable).
#
# Quality note: at 4-bit this is the most degraded placement of the 27B in the
# fleet. Unsloth's Dynamic V3.0 imatrix quants hold up well (their table puts
# even IQ2_XXS at ~82.5% of BF16 top-1), but if the task is quality-sensitive
# rather than throughput-sensitive, run it on the dual-R9700 or Strix Halo box.
#
# Concurrency note: --parallel SPLITS this context across slots rather than
# multiplying it. Keep PARALLEL at the launcher default of 1 for the full 262K
# on one request; there is not enough margin to raise it without also cutting
# CTX_SIZE.
: "${CTX_SIZE:=262144}"
: "${UBATCH:=512}"
